# Project Structure Guide

## Core Architecture

- **Main package**: [src/deepagents/](mdc:src/deepagents/) - Core agent framework
- **Examples**: [examples/research/](mdc:examples/research/) - Wine research implementation
- **Tests**: [tests/](mdc:tests/) - Comprehensive test suite

## Key Components

### Core Framework

- [src/deepagents/graph.py](mdc:src/deepagents/graph.py) - Main agent graph
- [src/deepagents/model.py](mdc:src/deepagents/model.py) - LLM model handling
- [src/deepagents/state.py](mdc:src/deepagents/state.py) - Agent state management
- [src/deepagents/tools.py](mdc:src/deepagents/tools.py) - Core tools

### Wine Research System

- [examples/research/wine_agent.py](mdc:examples/research/wine_agent.py) - Main wine research agent
- [examples/research/wine_models.py](mdc:examples/research/wine_models.py) - Wine data models
- [examples/research/export/](mdc:examples/research/export/) - WooCommerce CSV export system

### Database Integration

- **Qdrant**: [src/deepagents/qdrant/](mdc:src/deepagents/qdrant/) - Vector database
- **Neon PostgreSQL**: [examples/research/run_store.py](mdc:examples/research/run_store.py) - Run persistence

### Search Providers

- [src/deepagents/search/](mdc:src/deepagents/search/) - Search abstraction layer
- Supports Tavily and Jina search backends

## Progress Tracking

- Keep progress in `PROGRESS.md` files in each project/folder
- Use format: TS, PROBLEM, WHAT WAS DONE, MEMO
- Keep it short and concise
